      "title": "TFTP: Don't throw an exception in the heuristics",
      "message": "TFTP: Don't throw an exception in the heuristics\n\ntvb_strsize throws an exception if the tvb doesn't contain a NUL.\nCall functions that don't throw exceptions, like tvb_strnlen, and\ncheck boundary conditions. Return FALSE if we don't find two\nnull terminated strings.\n",
